# 6. Expected S3 path

The resulting S3 path is:

```text
s3://<raw-cdc-bucket>/
  oracle-cdc/
    dptf_source_system=oracle_trade/
      dptf_source_database=trading_prod/
        dptf_source_schema=TRADE/
          dptf_source_table=EXECUTIONS/
            dptf_ingest_date=2026-07-24/
              dptf_ingest_hour=09/
                TRADE.EXECUTIONS_REPTRDS3_<timestamp>_<uuid>.parquet
```

The hour is based on GoldenGate processing time in the JVM timezone.

Configure the GoldenGate JVM and operating environment to use UTC so that partition boundaries are deterministic across daylight-saving and host-location changes.

